msgstr "COHORT 146 / 分母聴聞"

#. copy/censusTitle
#: src/js/employment.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/censusTitle"
msgid "Where did the graduates go?"
msgstr "卒業生は、どこへ？"

#. copy/censusLead
#: src/js/employment.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/censusLead"
msgid ""
"Choose a counting rule and date range. Some graduates appear in several "
"categories; Aya has already picked the largest number for her headline."
msgstr "集計方法と期間を選んでください。複数の区分に入る卒業生もいます。文はもう、一番大きな数字を見出しに選びました。"

