msgid ""
"Accept the trial, request a correction, negotiate, or decline. Your reply is "
"saved with the employer's review."
msgstr "試験採用、訂正依頼、交渉、辞退から返答を選べます。返答は雇用主の審査と一緒に保存します。"

#. copy/responseNote
#: src/js/employment.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/responseNote"
